```

- Counters that modify P/T live in **7c** (CR 613.4c), alongside `+N/+N` effects.
- The **switch** is **7d** (CR 613.4d), applied **after** all of 7c.
- There is **no** "layer 7e" (grep for `613.4e` / `Layer 7e` in the CR returns nothing).

